 17592186045417 true] [17592186429941 1074 "First, we need to find two vectors that are parallel to the plane (but not to each other). Let's use the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{DE}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{DF},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =⟨-2,-2,5⟩-⟨1,0,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,-2,7⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{DF} & =⟨-2,4,3⟩-⟨1,0,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-3,4,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, if we consider the position vector $d=⟨1,0,-2⟩$ of the point $D,$ then the corresponding parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =d+s\\overset{\\to }{DE}+t\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\ r & =⟨1,0,-2⟩+s⟨-3,-2,7⟩+t⟨-3,4,5⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429942 1058 #edb/ref 17592186429943 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429942 1062 #uuid "6962e54d-afff-5346-b8ad-2f0747169762" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429942 1063 #edb/ref 17592186393057 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429943 1058 #edb/ref 17592186429944 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429943 1062 #uuid "80c6a6f7-a534-55d9-a6a9-83c73859670a" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429943 1063 #edb/ref 17592186429941 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429944 1058 #edb/ref 17592186429945 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429944 1062 #uuid "87cee5fb-f33c-5202-a9b9-1f5b449bede4" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429944 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262916 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429945 1062 #uuid "a96d0f38-f22e-54d6-9800-3b945209e167" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429945 1063 #edb/ref 17592186262922 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429946 1058 #edb/ref 17592186429942 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429946 1062 #uuid "b87c320e-e438-5e5e-b4bc-c722b9da8264" 13194139534626 17592186045417 true] [17592186429946 1063 #edb/ref 17592186391682 13194139534626 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"